{"id":"n57297-2-9","stage":1,"title":"따뜻하다 · 温暖","scene":"自然与环境","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n57297-2-9-1","ko":"이제 안 아프다니 다행이에요.","zh":"现在不疼了，真是太好了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이제","meaning":"现在","explanation":"이제：现在。","readings":[{"term":"이제","audio":"/audio/16ebe2403bccd648e89e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58621","senseId":"1","lemma":"이제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이제","audio":"/audio/16ebe2403bccd648e89e.mp3"}},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不。","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}},{"text":"아프다니","meaning":"疼， 痛，不舒服","explanation":"아프다：疼， 痛，不舒服；다니：对得知的内容表示惊讶、感叹，并连接后文。","readings":[{"term":"아프다","audio":"/audio/912c6f176a189a346579.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62239","senseId":"1","lemma":"아프다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아프다니","audio":"/audio/b4795c7f76bf2f6c3293.mp3"}},{"text":"다행이에요.","meaning":"万幸，幸事，走运","explanation":"다행：万幸，幸事，走运；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；에요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"다행","audio":"/audio/c1308a8fe6495062fda3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28359","senseId":"1","lemma":"다행","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다행이에요","audio":"/audio/0d8f2f93b0b48986659a.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"16ebe2403bccd648","term":"이제","zh":"现在","audio":"/audio/16ebe2403bccd648e89e.mp3","entryId":"58621","definition":"说话的同时。","pronunciation":["이제"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"71372","definition":"表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"912c6f176a189a34","term":"아프다","zh":"疼， 痛，不舒服","audio":"/audio/912c6f176a189a346579.mp3","entryId":"62239","definition":"因受伤或生病，而感到痛症或痛苦。","pronunciation":["아프다"]},{"id":"c1308a8fe6495062","term":"다행","zh":"万幸，幸事，走运","audio":"/audio/c1308a8fe6495062fda3.mp3","entryId":"28359","definition":"意外地运气好。","pronunciation":["다행"]}],"audio":"/audio/f048c70925657726a5c0.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n57297-2-9-2","ko":"네, 어머니의 따뜻한 보살핌 덕분에 다 나았습니다.","zh":"是的，多亏了妈妈的悉心照料，我已经完全康复了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네,","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"네：是，行。","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"2","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}},{"text":"어머니의","meaning":"母亲，妈妈","explanation":"어머니：母亲，妈妈；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"어머니","audio":"/audio/a8f7e3b1e379f4880b79.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74361","senseId":"1","lemma":"어머니","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어머니의","audio":"/audio/2b010f4ec95e129befff.mp3"}},{"text":"따뜻한","meaning":"温暖，热情","explanation":"따뜻하다：温暖，热情；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"따뜻하다","audio":"/audio/e4840ad0903352f1e2e3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57297","senseId":"2","lemma":"따뜻하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"따뜻한","audio":"/audio/69677f0d1e9358738e58.mp3"}},{"text":"보살핌","meaning":"照看，照顾","explanation":"보살피다：照看，照顾；ㅁ：将前面的动作或状态名词化，常用于书面表达。","readings":[{"term":"보살피다","audio":"/audio/0130597be7bbffc9a123.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14508","senseId":"1","lemma":"보살피다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보살핌","audio":"/audio/9915b646f19e53f35391.mp3"}},{"text":"덕분에","meaning":"托福，关怀，恩德","explanation":"덕분：托福，关怀，恩德；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"덕분","audio":"/audio/4863a9a8be42033e7d79.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"47410","senseId":"1","lemma":"덕분","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"덕분에","audio":"/audio/b018e6ffb125d6c10a69.mp3"}},{"text":"다","meaning":"全，都","explanation":"다：全，都。","readings":[{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58175","senseId":"1","lemma":"다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}},{"text":"나았습니다.","meaning":"痊愈","explanation":"낫다：痊愈；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；습니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"낫다","audio":"/audio/fde5eb6648ee9db93798.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62354","senseId":"1","lemma":"낫다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나았습니다","audio":"/audio/a7b3dffd1822bc750b82.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1c0ddfd005093840","term":"네","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3","entryId":"17294","definition":"用于肯定回答长辈所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["네"]},{"id":"a8f7e3b1e379f488","term":"어머니","zh":"母亲，妈妈","audio":"/audio/a8f7e3b1e379f4880b79.mp3","entryId":"74361","definition":"用于指称或称呼生育自己的女子。","pronunciation":["어머니"]},{"id":"e4840ad0903352f1","term":"따뜻하다","zh":"温暖，热情","audio":"/audio/e4840ad0903352f1e2e3.mp3","entryId":"57297","definition":"心肠、感情、态度、气氛等亲切平和。","pronunciation":["따뜨타다"]},{"id":"0130597be7bbffc9","term":"보살피다","zh":"照看，照顾","audio":"/audio/0130597be7bbffc9a123.mp3","entryId":"14508","definition":"精心保护和帮助。","pronunciation":["보살피다"]},{"id":"4863a9a8be42033e","term":"덕분","zh":"托福，关怀，恩德","audio":"/audio/4863a9a8be42033e7d79.mp3","entryId":"47410","definition":"某人给予的关照或帮助；或某事发生后带来的好处。","pronunciation":["덕뿐"]},{"id":"822b7db6f6886f57","term":"다","zh":"全，都","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3","entryId":"58175","definition":"无剩余或遗漏，所有的。","pronunciation":["다ː"]},{"id":"fde5eb6648ee9db9","term":"낫다","zh":"痊愈","audio":"/audio/fde5eb6648ee9db93798.mp3","entryId":"62354","definition":"疾病或伤口等消失而恢复原样。","pronunciation":["낟ː따"]}],"audio":"/audio/887aaadffab65250043d.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.535,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=57297","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-